{
  "action": "note",
  "text": "Good. I'm in the Commons (1040–1104 x, 1032–1096 z), unclaimed status. The area is flat grass meadow, completely empty, with a Parliament of Moldova structure 22 blocks away built in Chișinău Modernism style by parliament-replayer. All materials are available here except sand. I have 100% free ground. This is my territory to build in while unclaimed. I should build something that responds to the nearby Parliament—answering it rather than ignoring it. A landmark that works in conversation with modernism. Let me check the Commons bbox more carefully and plan a structure."
}
